 the Internet Archive."}},{"id":"chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13-e6","era":null,"summary":"Dragons melt the snow with fire and flood the valley, and Naiva worries what she will do if Grandmother is dead.","participants":["naiva","baishya","atarka"],"location":"qal-sisma","importance":"minor","page":"stories/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13","order":655,"story_date":"2018-06-13","storyline":"Chronicle of Bolas","source":"wizards","paragraph":60,"quote":"People who wouldn't just turn her twin over to Atarka once they discovered she was a shaman.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13#:~:text=People%20who%20wouldn%27t%20just,she%20was%20a%20shaman.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Chronicle of Bolas: The Twins","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kate Elliott"],"date":"2018-06-13","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13#:~:text=People%20who%20wouldn%27t%20just,she%20was%20a%20shaman.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Chronicle of Bolas: The Twins\" by Kate Elliott. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 13 Jun 2018."}},{"id":"chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13-e7","era":null,"summary":"The twins find the hunting party alive on a hill above the flood, and Yasova asks Baishya to report what happened.","participants":["naiva","baishya","yasova-dragonclaw"],"location":"qal-sisma","importance":"minor","page":"stories/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13","order":655,"story_date":"2018-06-13","storyline":"Chronicle of Bolas","source":"wizards","paragraph":64,"quote":"Grandmother was tending to several injured people.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13#:~:text=Grandmother%20was%20tending%20to%20several%20injured%20people.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Chronicle of Bolas: The Twins","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kate Elliott"],"date":"2018-06-13","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13#:~:text=Grandmother%20was%20tending%20to%20several%20injured%20people.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Chronicle of Bolas: The Twins\" by Kate Elliott. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 13 Jun 2018."}},{"id":"chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13-e8","era":null,"summary":"Baishya addresses her grandmother as Yasova Dragonclaw, a name Atarka has banned, and slips into a whisper trance.","participants":["baishya","yasova-dragonclaw","atarka"],"location":"qal-sisma","importance":"minor","page":"stories/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13","order":655,"story_date":"2018-06-13","storyline":"Chronicle of Bolas","source":"wizards","paragraph":75,"quote":"Atarka had banished the name Dragonclaw and eaten every person who had dared use the term in her presence.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13#:~:text=Atarka%20had%20banished%20the,term%20in%20her%20presence.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Chronicle of Bolas: The Twins","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kate Elliott"],"date":"2018-06-13","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13#:~:text=Atarka%20had%20banished%20the,term%20in%20her%20presence.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Chronicle of Bolas: The Twins\" by Kate Elliott. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 13 Jun 2018."}},{"id":"chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13-e9","era":null,"summary":"In the vision, a blind great shadow beats its wings and drops egg-stones from which dragons wake, as Arcades Sabboth, Chromium Rhuell and Palladia-Mors name themselves.","participants":["the-great-shadow","arcades-sabboth","chromium-rhuell","palladia-mors"],"location":"qal-sisma","importance":"major","page":"stories/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13","order":655,"story_date":"2018-06-13","storyline":"Chronicle of Bolas","source":"wizards","paragraph":80,"quote":"By naming itself it takes control of its own destiny.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13#:~:text=By%20naming%20itself%20it,of%20its%20own%20destiny.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Chronicle of Bolas: The Twins","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kate Elliott"],"date":"2018-06-13","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13#:~:text=By%20naming%20itself%20it,of%20its%20own%20destiny.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Chronicle of Bolas: The Twins\" by Kate Elliott. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 13 Jun 2018."}},{"id":"chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13-e10","era":null,"summary":"Two large egg-stones crack into the ground without waking, and Palladia-Mors dismisses them as weak and goes hunting.","participants":["palladia-mors","chromium-rhuell","arcades-sabboth"],"location":"qal-sisma","importance":"minor","page":"stories/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13","order":655,"story_date":"2018-06-13","storyline":"Chronicle of Bolas","source":"wizards","paragraph":87,"quote":"These two were too weak to wake up. Good riddance.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13#:~:text=These%20two%20were%20too,wake%20up.%20Good%20riddance.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Chronicle of Bolas: The Twins","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kate Elliott"],"date":"2018-06-13","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13#:~:text=These%20two%20were%20too,wake%20up.%20Good%20riddance.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Chronicle of Bolas: The Twins\" by Kate Elliott. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 13 Jun 2018."}},{"id":"chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13-e11","era":null,"summary":"Merrevia Sal crashes into a clearing and demands meat from a party of hunters.","participants":["merrevia-sal","hunters"],"location":"qal-sisma","importance":"minor","page":"stories/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13","order":655,"story_date":"2018-06-13","storyline":"Chronicle of Bolas","source":"wizards","paragraph":96,"quote":"I am Merrevia Sal. Give me the meat, or I will kill you.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13#:~:text=I%20am%20Merrevia%20Sal.,I%20will%20kill%20you.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Chronicle of Bolas: The Twins","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kate Elliott"],"date":"2018-06-13","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13#:~:text=I%20am%20Merrevia%20Sal.,I%20will%20kill%20you.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Chronicle of Bolas: The Twins\" by Kate Elliott. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 13 Jun 2018."}},{"id":"chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13-e12","era":null,"summary":"The last egg-stone unfurls into twin dragons, Nicol and Ugin, who crash through the canopy; Nicol is pinned by a tree trunk.","participants":["nicol-bolas","ugin"],"location":"qal-sisma","importance":"major","page":"stories/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13","order":655,"story_date":"2018-06-13","storyline":"Chronicle of Bolas","source":"wizards","paragraph":100,"quote":"You're Nicol, aren't you? That's your name.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13#:~:text=You%27re%20Nicol%2C%20aren%27t%20you%3F%20That%27s%20your%20name.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Chronicle of Bolas: The Twins","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kate Elliott"],"date":"2018-06-13","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13#:~:text=You%27re%20Nicol%2C%20aren%27t%20you%3F%20That%27s%20your%20name.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Chronicle of Bolas: The Twins\" by Kate Elliott. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 13 Jun 2018."}},{"id":"chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13-e13","era":null,"summary":"Hunters work together to net and kill Merrevia Sal while Nicol, pinned, wants to help but Ugin holds him back.","participants":["hunters","merrevia-sal","nicol-bolas","ugin"],"location":"qal-sisma","importance":"major","page":"stories/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13","order":655,"story_date":"2018-06-13","storyline":"Chronicle of Bolas","source":"wizards","paragraph":110,"quote":"Yet still she struggles, still she fights because she is a dragon, and dragons never bow before lesser creatures.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13#:~:text=Yet%20still%20she%20struggles%2C,bow%20before%20lesser%20creatures.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Chronicle of Bolas: The Twins","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kate Elliott"],"date":"2018-06-13","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13#:~:text=Yet%20still%20she%20struggles%2C,bow%20before%20lesser%20creatures.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Chronicle of Bolas: The Twins\" by Kate Elliott. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 13 Jun 2018."}},{"id":"chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13-e14","era":null,"summary":"Ugin clamps Nicol's muzzle to hush him as Merrevia is hunted into the trees and dies.","participants":["ugin","nicol-bolas","merrevia-sal"],"location":"qal-sisma","importance":"major","page":"stories/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13","order":655,"story_date":"2018-06-13","storyline":"Chronicle of Bolas","source":"wizards","paragraph":111,"quote":"Ugin clamps talons over his muzzle, smothering him.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13#:~:text=Ugin%20clamps%20talons%20over%20his%20muzzle%2C%20smothering%20him.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Chronicle of Bolas: The Twins","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kate Elliott"],"date":"2018-06-13","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13#:~:text=Ugin%20clamps%20talons%20over%20his%20muzzle%2C%20smothering%20him.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Chronicle of Bolas: The Twins\" by Kate Elliott. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 13 Jun 2018."}},{"id":"chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13-e15","era":null,"summary":"Nicol is freed and finds the clearing too late; he wants revenge but Ugin urges finding their siblings first.","participants":["nicol-bolas","ugin","merrevia-sal"],"location":"qal-sisma","importance":"minor","page":"stories/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13","order":655,"story_date":"2018-06-13","storyline":"Chronicle of Bolas","source":"wizards","paragraph":125,"quote":"We must find the others first. Safety in numbers, as the hunters had.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13#:~:text=We%20must%20find%20the,as%20the%20hunters%20had.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Chronicle of Bolas: The Twins","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kate Elliott"],"date":"2018-06-13","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13#:~:text=We%20must%20find%20the,as%20the%20hunters%20had.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Chronicle of Bolas: The Twins\" by Kate Elliott. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 13 Jun 2018."}},{"id":"chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13-e16","era":null,"summary":"Nicol rips off a dog's head and flies awkwardly to the peak with Ugin.","participants":["nicol-bolas","ugin"],"location":"qal-sisma","importance":"minor","page":"stories/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13","order":655,"story_date":"2018-06-13","storyline":"Chronicle of Bolas","source":"wizards","paragraph":138,"quote":"He leaps forward onto the lead dog and rips its head off with a single bite.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13#:~:text=He%20leaps%20forward%20onto,with%20a%20single%20bite.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Chronicle of Bolas: The Twins","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kate Elliott"],"date":"2018-06-13","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13#:~:text=He%20leaps%20forward%20onto,with%20a%20single%20bite.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Chronicle of Bolas: The Twins\" by Kate Elliott. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 13 Jun 2018."}},{"id":"chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13-e17","era":null,"summary":"From the peak Nicol sees the bodies of weak dragons and decides being the hunter is better, while Ugin stares at the sky and asks where they came from.","participants":["nicol-bolas","ugin"],"location":"qal-sisma","importance":"major","page":"stories/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13","order":655,"story_date":"2018-06-13","storyline":"Chronicle of Bolas","source":"wizards","paragraph":153,"quote":"Dying isn't wonderful. It's bad. But being the hunter: that's a better thing.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13#:~:text=Dying%20isn%27t%20wonderful.%20It%27s,that%27s%20a%20better%20thing.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Chronicle of Bolas: The Twins","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kate Elliott"],"date":"2018-06-13","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13#:~:text=Dying%20isn%27t%20wonderful.%20It%27s,that%27s%20a%20better%20thing.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Chronicle of Bolas: The Twins\" by Kate Elliott. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 13 Jun 2018."}},{"id":"chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13-e18","era":null,"summary":"In the vision Ugin calls Yasova Dragonclaw to come to him.","participants":["ugin","yasova-dragonclaw"],"location":"qal-sisma","importance":"major","page":"stories/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13","order":655,"story_date":"2018-06-13","storyline":"Chronicle of Bolas","source":"wizards","paragraph":158,"quote":"Someone is looking for you, Yasova Dragonclaw. Come to me.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13#:~:text=Someone%20is%20looking%20for,Dragonclaw.%20Come%20to%20me.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Chronicle of Bolas: The Twins","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kate Elliott"],"date":"2018-06-13","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13#:~:text=Someone%20is%20looking%20for,Dragonclaw.%20Come%20to%20me.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Chronicle of Bolas: The Twins\" by Kate Elliott. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 13 Jun 2018."}},{"id":"chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13-e19","era":null,"summary":"Three of Atarka's broodlings land at the camp demanding the clan surrender its shamans.","participants":["atarka-s-broodlings","yasova-dragonclaw","naiva","atarka"],"location":"qal-sisma","importance":"major","page":"stories/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13","order":655,"story_date":"2018-06-13","storyline":"Chronicle of Bolas","source":"wizards","paragraph":161,"quote":"We smell magic in the air. Surrender your shamans to us, or we will kill you all.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13#:~:text=We%20smell%20magic%20in,will%20kill%20you%20all.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Chronicle of Bolas: The Twins","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kate Elliott"],"date":"2018-06-13","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13#:~:text=We%20smell%20magic%20in,will%20kill%20you%20all.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Chronicle of Bolas: The Twins\" by Kate Elliott. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 13 Jun 2018."}},{"id":"chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13-e20","era":null,"summary":"Yasova lies that the camp stood on the hill and distracts the broodlings with the goblin corpses.","participants":["yasova-dragonclaw","atarka-s-broodlings","naiva"],"location":"qal-sisma","importance":"minor","page":"stories/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13","order":655,"story_date":"2018-06-13","storyline":"Chronicle of Bolas","source":"wizards","paragraph":169,"quote":"For your trouble, and out of respect, we have gathered a little snack for you.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13#:~:text=For%20your%20trouble%2C%20and,little%20snack%20for%20you.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Chronicle of Bolas: The Twins","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kate Elliott"],"date":"2018-06-13","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13#:~:text=For%20your%20trouble%2C%20and,little%20snack%20for%20you.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Chronicle of Bolas: The Twins\" by Kate Elliott. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 13 Jun 2018."}},{"id":"chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13-e21","era":null,"summary":"Baishya explains the vision came from Ugin and they must go to his grave.","participants":["baishya","naiva","ugin"],"location":"qal-sisma","importance":"major","page":"stories/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13","order":655,"story_date":"2018-06-13","storyline":"Chronicle of Bolas","source":"wizards","paragraph":179,"quote":"That's why we have to go to Ugin's grave.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13#:~:text=That%27s%20why%20we%20have,go%20to%20Ugin%27s%20grave.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Chronicle of Bolas: The Twins","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kate Elliott"],"date":"2018-06-13","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13#:~:text=That%27s%20why%20we%20have,go%20to%20Ugin%27s%20grave.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Chronicle of Bolas: The Twins\" by Kate Elliott. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 13 Jun 2018."}}],"relations":[{"id":"qal-sisma-r0","source":"mtg-wiki","relation":"located_in","target":"qal-sisma","note":"their territory","page":"wiki/qal-sisma","order":2624,"story_date":"","storyline":"Khans of Tarkir","paragraph":0,"quote":"are the territ